WEBVTT

00:12:27.476 --> 00:12:32.836
The city's tram and meters
are already electric,

00:12:32.876 --> 00:12:36.516
and nearly all the ferries are electric.

00:12:36.836 --> 00:12:40.036
And by the end of 2023,

00:12:40.076 --> 00:12:44.356
every bus in Oslo
will be electric as well.

00:12:44.396 --> 00:12:47.876
Bus drivers love this development

00:12:47.916 --> 00:12:51.396
because an electric bus
is more pleasant to drive,

00:12:51.436 --> 00:12:55.636
and it creates no noise nor gases.

00:12:56.036 --> 00:12:58.316
So fifth lesson learned,

00:12:58.356 --> 00:13:01.916
don't underestimate
how technology changes markets